# Working-memory reminder check — every 5 minutes.
# Install: crontab -e, then paste the line below (replace the paths with
# your own — the package dir and your ~/.hermes dir). Logs land in
# ~/.hermes/logs/wm-reminders.log.
#
# No Telegram? Skip this line. Instead register a Hermes no_agent cron job
# (every 5 minutes, script=reminder-check.py, deliver to your home channel):
# the script prints only due reminders, which the scheduler delivers verbatim.
*/5 * * * * /path/to/working-memory-system/reminder-check.py >> $HOME/.hermes/logs/wm-reminders.log 2>&1
